{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Baby Journal 是一款為新手父母而設的育兒記錄應用，主打極速輸入，三下即可完成餵奶、換尿片、睡眠與成長里程碑等重要記錄，並在一天之中隨時翻查歷史。內建深色模式方便夜間記錄，支援 16 種語言，無需帳戶、不經雲端，所有資料只存放於裝置之上，亦可自行匯出備份。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>三下完成寶寶日常記錄</h2>\n<p>記錄流程以速度為先，每次新增最多隻需三下點擊，換尿片、餵奶、睡眠、筆記與里程碑都能迅速完成，全天候隨時查看歷史。深色模式讓夜間追蹤不刺眼，支援 16 種語言，切合不同家庭需要。應用不設帳戶與雲端同步，資料只留在裝置之上，並提供簡單的備份匯出與匯入，讓父母在疲倦時仍能輕鬆掌握寶寶作息。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-31-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-32-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-34-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Baby Journal: Activity tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T20:38:12.593624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}